易怀了孩子，竟遇到这么个脑子糊涂了的侄女！”“万一……可如何是好？”“嘘，听说二夫人都已经吩咐下去了，只待蓉姐儿出来，便叫小厮押了蓉姐儿去见官！”梨园主屋外，二夫人房内的掌事妈妈对着身旁的小丫鬟小声吩咐道：“赶紧去产房外再看看，看看蓉姐儿出来没有，都那么长时间了，照理说，孩子若生下来，也该生下来了。顺便也叫外门的小厮准备好，若是二奶奶去了，报官的人要立刻赶往衙门，这是二夫人吩咐下来的事情，千万不要搞砸了，不然仔细你的皮。”看着小丫鬟点了点头，便快速离开办事，二夫人房中的掌事常妈妈不禁轻叹一口气：“可怜的蓉姐儿，好好的嫡女沦落成庶女也就罢了，如今恐怕性命都要丢了。”一旁跟着守在外面的巧儿撇撇嘴：“这哪里是她可怜，若不是她自己要强出头，整出什么剖腹取子，能有这样的事情吗？老话说的好，天作孽犹可违自作孽不可活！”“你们在说什么？”两人零零散散说着话，突然一个声音打断所有人的话。两人面色微微不自然，赶忙回头，当看到来人是一脸苍白的钟氏之时，面色恢复镇定。“见过钟姨娘，我们没说什么，您这是要去见太夫人吗？”常妈妈对着钟氏快速反问道，一时之间打断了钟氏的询问。越是这样，钟氏眉头便皱的越紧，心中揪紧，却没再说什么，只是对着常妈妈点了点头。“太夫人就在屋里，您直接过去便可以了。”丫鬟对着钟氏快速的说道：“奴婢们还有些活，这便先退下了。”说着话，常妈妈便拉着巧儿离开了主屋门外。钟氏却是眉头紧紧皱起，之后的每一步都觉得沉重。“姨娘，不要担心，小姐聪明伶俐，不会出什么事情的。”一旁扶着的冬儿大约感觉到钟氏的担忧，不禁开口安慰道。钟氏却没有回话，只是眉头皱的更紧了。剖腹取子这样的事情，岂是聪明伶俐的人办的出来的？又岂是聪明伶俐可以推过去的？这个女儿自从醒过来，性格爱好也变得太多了！虽然这么想着，钟氏脚下的脚步仍忍不住比平常要快上一些。而一直守在门口的春晴看到钟氏，便赶快离了主屋，向产房跑去。产房外，等的人不少，都是各个主子身边伺候的丫鬟，只见她们几个人围成一堆，同二奶奶和钟氏关系好的，都面带忧色，那些关系不好的，却是满脸笑容。“这天气真冷，只是这么久都还不出来，恐怕是事情做砸了，不敢出来了！”“连御医都做不了的事情，还敢胡乱逞强，这结果想都不用想，还好，我们不是在她手下当差，不然怎么被害死的都不知道！”“只可怜了二奶奶，不仅丢了孩子，连性命也丢了。”“就是，三小姐真该死。”这些丫鬟不远处，一身月牙白袍子的上官辰面色越来越黑。“吱呀——”突然，产房的门打开，院子外，瞬间寂静无声。大夫人和史御医缓缓走出。那些丫鬟婆子见蓉姐儿没一起出来，面上神色转动，有那手脚快的，竟是连话都不说，只和身旁一起的丫鬟使了个眼色，便快速的向外院跑去。大夫人和史御医却没发现下面的变化，只是呼吸到外面的空气，两人都不禁舒了一口气。“大夫人，蓉姐儿怎么样了？”不等旁人问话，上官辰已经抢先一步上前询问大夫人。虽然觉得上官辰关心的有些不合时宜，不过想到母子平安的喜事，大夫人还是对着上官辰露出一个大大的笑容：“蓉姐儿很好，不仅她很好，二奶奶也很好，还生了个大胖小子，现在母子平安！”院中瞬间寂静，所有丫鬟婆子都不禁瞪大眼睛，惊愕的愣住。母子平安？真的假的？不是说连史御医都毫无办法吗？蓉姐儿怎么可能做到？如果是真的，这岂不是说，一直养在深闺的蓉姐儿医术竟然比御医都要强。望着所有人的惊讶，史御医不禁笑起，自己之前可也是和这些人一样，从震惊到极点，继而是惊佩，只是简简单单的在家中看书，便能从书中就学到这么厉害的医术，柳蓉绝对是医学天才，只可惜是个女儿身。听到大夫人的话，上官辰不禁笑起，转身潇洒离去，一旁一直陪着他站在产房外等着的柳博不禁一愣，赶忙追着上官辰离开。“好了，都别发愣了，赶紧去报喜，这可是天大的喜事！”大夫人笑着对一群依旧处于发愣中，完全反应不过来的丫鬟婆子笑着说道。“是！”丫鬟婆子纷纷应是，随即转身离开，其中有一个却是面色苍白惊慌，随着大夫人的话，慌慌张张的快步向外院冲去。大夫人却是没有注意这一点，只觉得今日的天气比往常要好一些，想着这些丫鬟婆子既然帮她通知大家了，她犹豫着要不要这会先回去歇歇，毕竟是年纪大了，折腾了这么久，也确实是累了。“大夫人，大夫人！钟氏到主屋了。”正当大夫人想着，便见春晴小跑到大夫人跟前。大夫人一愣，随即想到之前自己见蓉姐儿倔强，便想着旁人劝不了，钟氏应该劝得了，未免蓉姐儿吃亏，才找的钟氏。只是这会钟氏到主屋，大夫人、二夫人、大奶奶都在气头上，恐怕会不好。想了一下，大夫人快步回屋通知蓉姐儿这件事情。柳蓉听到钟氏来了，心中一惊，这才想起一件重要的事情，钟氏一直照顾她，自然知道她根本没有专研医术，这会她突然表现出这样的能力……一时之间，柳蓉只觉得心惊肉跳！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/houmenyinu/10.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 10 The sequelae of caesarean section Liu Rong shook her head at the eldest lady: \"Grandma, please go with Dr. Shi, just take a rest outside. You are tired after struggling for a long time. I just stay here and watch.\" After speaking, Liu Rong looked at the second grandma who was still in a coma on the bed and her breathing was very weak: \"The next time is the most dangerous time for the second grandma. , If nothing happens these days, it will be better after getting through it, but if you can't make it, I'm afraid...\" Liu Rong did not continue, but the joyful atmosphere in the room faded. Mother Li looked worriedly at the second grandma on the bed, holding the child's hand, tightened unconsciously, and then returned to it, but the expression on her face became determined. \"Second Grandma will definitely be able to persevere. She persevered even in the most difficult times.\" The eldest lady sighed slightly and comforted her. \"Yes, what grandma said is true.\" Liu Rong nodded to the eldest lady and said nothing more. The eldest lady, who was already tired, said nothing more and led Dr. Shi out of the delivery room. After the eldest lady went out, Liu Rong walked to the child and examined the child carefully. The skin that had turned red due to lack of oxygen had returned to normal. The child's skin was wrinkled like other newborns, but the eyes were open and moist like other newborns. Liu Rong looked at him, and the child actually looked straight at Liu Rong. Liu Rong couldn't help but feel soft in her heart: \"You must be filial to your mother in the future, and you won't deserve her efforts to give birth to you.\" \"This child is smart at first glance, and he will definitely be sensible and filial in the future.\" Mother Li, who was looking after her, said quickly. Liu Rong nodded and stopped looking at the child, but said to Mother Li: \"I have checked the child and everything is healthy. But even so, you have to be careful. Children born by caesarean section are generally not as healthy as children born normally. It is easy to get sick at such a young age. If you get sick, it will be difficult to treat.\" After everything was done, Liu Rong took a breath. Looking at the baby with moist eyes, Liu Rong couldn't help but show a satisfied smile. Rebirth is hope. No matter what happens to the second grandma, at least her greatest persistence and greatest wish have been realized. The child was born and was still healthy. But it was said that there was a race against time in the delivery room, but there was a lot of discussion outside the delivery room. When they saw the Tai Madam, the Second Madam, and Grandma Liu coming out with pale faces, everyone made various guesses, but no one dared to approach the masters to ask about the specific situation. It wasn't until several masters went to the main room to rest and the second master appeared and asked about the situation in the delivery room that the news quietly spread, and everyone knew that Sister Rong had really performed a caesarean section to retrieve the baby for the second grandma. \"Sister Rong is so stupid that she even did such an unbelievable thing. Why didn't the masters stop such a ridiculous thing?\" \"It is said that Sister Rong took advantage of the masters not paying attention and took action. The masters did not dare to stop at this critical moment. I only pity the second mistress. She finally got pregnant and met such a confused niece!\" \"What if...but... What should I do? \"Shh, I heard that the second lady has already ordered her to leave. As soon as Sister Rong comes out, she will ask the servant to escort her to see the official!\" Outside the main house of the Liyuan, the mother in charge of the second lady's room whispered to the little maid next to her: \"Hurry and check outside the delivery room to see if Sister Rong has come out. It has been so long. Logically speaking, if the baby is born, it should be born. . By the way, also ask the servants at the outer door to get ready. If the Second Mistress goes, the person who reports to the official must rush to the Yamen immediately. This is what the Second Mistress has ordered. Don't mess up, otherwise you will be careful.\" Seeing the little maid nodded and quickly left to do the work, the second Mistress's room manager Chang Mama couldn't help but sigh: \"Poor Sister Rong, it's just like a good eldest daughter to be reduced to a concubine. Well, now I'm afraid my life will be lost.\" Qiao'er, who was watching outside, pouted and said, \"How pitiful is she? If she hadn't forced herself to do it, how could such a thing have happened? As the old saying goes, you can't live without your own fault!\" \"What are you talking about?\" The two of them were talking scatteredly, and suddenly a voice interrupted everyone. The two of them looked slightly unnatural, and quickly turned around. When they saw that the person coming was the pale-faced Mrs. Zhong, their expressions returned to calmness. \"We've met Aunt Zhong, but we didn't say anything. Are you going to see Mrs. Zhong?\" Mother Chang asked quickly to Zhong, interrupting Zhong's inquiry for a moment. The more this happened, the more Zhong frowned and her heart tightened, but she didn't say anything and just nodded to Chang's mother. \"Mrs. Tai is in the house, you can just go over there.\" The maid said quickly to Mrs. Zhong: \"The servants still have some work to do, so please leave first.\" As she spoke, Chang's mother took Qiao'er and left the door of the main house. Zhong's brows furrowed tightly, and every step he took after that felt heavy. \"Auntie, don't worry. The young lady is smart and nothing will happen to her.\" Dong'er, who was supporting her on the side, seemed to feel Zhong's worry and couldn't help but comfort her. Zhong didn't reply, but her brows furrowed even more tightly. How could a smart person do such a thing as removing a child by caesarean section? How can you push through it if you are smart? Since this daughter woke up, her personality and hobbies have become too many! Even though he was thinking this, Zhong couldn't help but move faster than usual. When Chunqing, who had been guarding the door, saw Ms. Zhong, she quickly left the main room and ran to the delivery room. Outside the delivery room, there were many people waiting, all of them were maids serving the various masters. They were gathered in a group. They all had worried faces with the Second Mistress and Mrs. Zhong who had a good relationship with them, while those with bad relationships had smiles on their faces. \"It's really cold. I just haven't come out for so long. I'm afraid something went wrong.\"", "translated": true, "title_en": "Chapter 10"}